# Gallery Images Directory

Place your painting images in this folder.

## Image Organization

- Use descriptive filenames (e.g., `radha-krishna.jpg`)
- Recommended format: JPG or WebP for better compression
- Recommended size: 400x500 pixels or larger
- Update the `imageUrl` in `src/pages/gallery.tsx` to match your filenames

Example:
```
gallery/
├── radha-krishna.jpg
├── durga-puja.jpg
├── village-life.jpg
└── ...
```

Then update gallery.tsx:
```typescript
imageUrl: '/images/gallery/radha-krishna.jpg'
```
